  "prefLabel": "Ed 1021.04 Mediation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1021.04 Mediation.\n\n(a) Mediation shall be voluntary and available to individuals in accordance with 34 CFR 361.57(d), and Ed 205.\n\n(b) If mediation as described in Ed 205.03 is selected by the parties and resolution is not achieved, the individual selected as a mediator shall not be the same individual who is subsequently appointed as a hearing officer to preside at a hearing in the same matter pursuant to Ed 1021.10(c).\n\n(c) Inconsistencies between mediation procedures in Ed 205.03 and Ed 1021.05 shall be resolved in favor of the provisions of Ed 1021.05.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1000.html"
